dsh-harness-zh
==============

MIT License. See LICENSE.

This package is derived from and interoperates with the following projects:

1. DeepSeek Harness (DSH)
   The English source strings in dict/*.json are the model-visible prompt text
   shipped inside DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.5 (system prompt sections, runtime
   context templates, tool and parameter descriptions, Cordis API catalog).
   Those strings remain the property of their authors. The Simplified Chinese
   translations and the plugin code in this repository are original work
   released under the MIT License. No proprietary DSH source code is bundled:
   the dictionaries contain prompt text and translations only.

2. dsh-harness-zh-cn (https://github.com/zjl1989-li/dsh-harness-zh-cn)
   MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 dsh-harness-zh contributors.
   The file dict/cordis-api.json is a derivative of that project's Cordis API
   dictionary: 813 of its 1241 entries were re-verified against the
   0.2.1-rc.5 api-catalog.js, kept as-is or corrected, and 428 stale entries
   were dropped. Its translations are used under the MIT License above.
   This project is an independent rewrite for DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 and is not
   affiliated with or endorsed by that project.

3. Cordis (https://github.com/cordiverse/cordis)
   The API catalog text translated in dict/cordis-api.json describes the
   Cordis service API exposed by DeepSeek Harness.

Trademarks (DeepSeek, DeepSeek Harness, Cordis, PowerShell, MCP and others)
belong to their respective owners and are used only to identify the systems
this plugin translates.
